.env
.env.*

# ── Claude Code local files ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Kept local rather than public: CLAUDE.md documents detection internals/
# limitations (e.g. exactly what the PDF flow does and doesn't auto-detect) -
# not a secret, but not something we want to hand a public roadmap of to
# anyone who clones/forks this repo either. Untracked as of 2026-08-25; still
# read locally by Claude Code, just no longer synced to GitHub going forward.
.claude/
CLAUDE.md

# ── Legacy source (excluded from packaging too) ──────────────────────────────
_legacy/

# ── Sensitive data — NEVER commit ────────────────────────────────────────────
# This is a PII tool. Real spreadsheets, PDFs, the name→pseudonym crosswalk (the
# re-identification KEY — for pseudonymized Excel output, this is embedded as a
# "Crosswalk" sheet inside the .xlsx itself, not just a separate CSV), and the
# master list (real staff names + IDs) are all Confidential under IPA's
# data-classification policy and must never enter version control. The app reads
# the master list from a local file that each machine supplies out-of-band;
# MasterListRepository tolerates its absence.
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.xlsm
*.pdf
*_crosswalk.csv
# Master list and any other data CSVs (real names) — keep local, never commit.
data/*.csv
